<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An article that manifests whenever someone tries to view or write it.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The article itself is the SCP. Whenever someone tries to read, write, edit, copy or print this article , the anomalous version suddenly manifests. It is written entirely in first person, and everything it says is true. It was discovered when the foundation attempted to write the SCP after that.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The article is the anomaly.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>It's short and under level 4 clearance.</p>

