<p>Hello hello! As I understand, you know your stuff SCP-wise, but I'd say a warm welcome is due nonetheless! I am 99% sure you know <em>everything</em> I'll include in this comment already, but just to make sure and for that 1% you'll get something useful out of it, I'll include that resource copypasta under the collapsible nonetheless. You never know what might come in handy!</p>
<p>On a different note though, it's awesome to see some of the -INT people make their way onto our main site Hopefully you'll find what you seek here and improve as much as you wanted to!</p>
